155
00:09:16.866 --> 00:09:20.100
Ouvrez grand vos oreilles et soyez bien sages.

156
00:09:20.166 --> 00:09:22.600
Notre ballon survolait Illumis,

157
00:09:22.666 --> 00:09:24.733
