221
00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.233
Je compte sur toi, Mucuscule !

222
00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.366
Mucuscule !

223
00:12:43.433 --> 00:12:47.500
Dedenne, De !

224
00:12:47.566 --> 00:12:50.233
Groret !

225
00:12:52.833 --> 00:12:54.900
Dedenne !

226
00:12:57.566 --> 00:13:00.566
